  "term": "radiography",
  "definition": "In this packet, radiography refers specifically to dynamic digital radiography, a bedside imaging method that provides real-time views of lung movement while using relatively little radiation. It is described as a way to derive measures that may help estimate risk of breathing problems after extubation in ICU patients.",
